-// Malloc-free implementation.
-MappedNameBuffer ConstructMappedNameBuffer(GuestAddr guest_addr) {
+// Malloc-free implementation. Sets *file_offset to guest_addr's offset in the
+// mapped file, which identifies the region across launches where the address
+// does not, and *file_backed to whether there is one: anonymous memory (a guest
